# Normalise line endings.
#
# This repo is authored on Windows but will be cloned on macOS and Linux. Without
# this, every file Git touches gets CRLF in the working copy and the next person
# to open it on another platform sees a whole-file diff on save.
#
# `text=auto` stores LF in the repository and checks out the platform default.
* text=auto

# Lockfiles: LF everywhere, so a Windows install cannot produce a diff that looks
# like every dependency changed.
package-lock.json text eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF or they will not execute on Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary — never touch, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
